{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運港隊於輪椅劍擊項目，憑余翠怡女子A級花劍個人賽，奪得一面銅牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n余翠怡準決賽面對國家隊劍手鄒緒鳳，初段稍為佔先，但其後被反先。鄒緒鳳中段領先8:5。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n余翠怡之後一度追近到兩分差距，但最終被拉開分數，以9:15落敗，由於賽事不設銅牌賽，余翠怡為港隊奪得一面銅牌。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：李俊傑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T09:39:27.599970+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:23:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T18:18:07.189151+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T09:37:44.934603+00:00","content_hash":"a987a75a469b412840c070200e89244bada26e41e62bf5d9f560a40a81fd57d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}